  📗
    What the layer does with *r* at *now*, seconds since 1970: hands it on
    when its route is open or its token is what the route asks for, and
    refuses it otherwise, with 401 for no token or one that does not hold and
    403 for one that holds and lacks the role or the scope. The app makes
    the layer from this, and gives it the system's time.
